\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Christ availed himself to us
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and left all His good samples
\par He gave to us that great charge
\par To do  as the Master will.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. How he did come down to earth
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and humbled himself greatly
\par and was very patient too
\par was a good example too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He obeyed his father's rules
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 loved his enemies also
\par and consoled them all as well
\par He says we should do the same.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. He pleaded with his father
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and was very honest too
\par What was it he was asking?
\par Look at him and do the same.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. How he with perseverance
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 spread news of heav'nly kingdom
\par and was one with his father
\par He says, "You should do the same"
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.\cf0  He ate, drunk with modesty
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 without any malice too
\par and He blessed what e'er he ate
\par He says '"we should do likewise!"
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. My teacher and bosom friend
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Look!  I have not got much strength
\par  Fill me with your spirit too
\par And I'll bear the fruits indeed.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. How you pleaded into death
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To end your life here on earth
\par Let me also die like that
\par \pard     And come to you there above.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

